{{:Header/Limbo}}

The ethereal plane can first be accessed after you've defeated Keymaster Y in the [[Grasslands]] Zone. Once you've completed this, unlock the first perk from the [[Perks#Blue Limbo Perk Tree|Blue Perk Tree]] and enter a peculiar rift that's now available from the [[Fishing]] docks. After you've done this once, you can permanently access Limbo from the top left menu.


[[File:Limbo_rift.png|center]]


Limbo features three activities: [[Spiriting]], [[Summoning]], and [[Contracts]]. Spiriting generates souls which you spend on building Summoning Rifts, which provide additional bonuses towards most aspects of the game. Contracting is a quest-based feature where you earn merit badges that unlock [[Ascension]] Perks, auto progression for zones, and various additional boosts.


